flowchart TD
    A[Interview Q&A workflow] --> B[Frontend input]
    B --> B1[Job IDs]
    B --> B2[CV path]
    B --> B3[Recent days]
    B --> B4[Max jobs]
    B --> B5[Start job time]
    B --> B6[JD text or JD file]
    B --> B7[Force]
    B --> B8[Shutdown when completed]

    A --> C[Frontend normalization]
    C --> C1[Repeat --job-id]
    C --> C2[Add --cv-path]
    C --> C3[Clamp --recent-days]
    C --> C4[Clamp --limit]
    C --> C5[Encode --jd-text-base64]
    C --> C6[Convert run_at to ISO UTC]

    C --> D{Has run_at?}
    D -->|No| E[Create running automation run]
    D -->|Yes| F[Create pending automation run]
    F --> F1[Store scheduled_for and scheduled_args]
    F1 --> F2[Scheduler date trigger]
    F2 --> F3[execute_pending_run]
    F3 --> G[execute_action_run]
    E --> G

    F --> F4[Restart after scheduled_for can leave run pending]
    F4 --> F5[UI rescue actions]
    F5 --> F6[Recall]
    F5 --> F7[Set Time]

    G --> H[Spawn predict_night.py]
    H --> I{Feature flag on or force?}
    I -->|No| J[Skip safely]
    I -->|Yes| K[Read CV]

    K --> L[Load jobs from SQLite]
    K --> M[Decode JD text]
    L --> N[Build candidate jobs]
    M --> N
    N --> O[Collect evidence]
    O --> P[Assemble prompt]
    P --> Q[Generate with local model]
    Q --> R{Vet pass?}
    R -->|Yes| S[Vet result]
    R -->|No| T[Use generate result]
    S --> U[Persist results]
    T --> U
    U --> V[Write summary artifacts and logs]
    V --> W{Shutdown flag?}
    W -->|Yes| X[Issue shutdown]
    W -->|No| Y[Finish run]

    A --> Z[Lightweight pipeline for weak machines]
    Z --> Z1[Target setup]
    Z1 --> Z2[Source priority]
    Z2 --> Z3[Lightweight crawl]
    Z3 --> Z4[Robots cache]
    Z3 --> Z5[Fetch HTML]
    Z3 --> Z6[Extract minimal text]
    Z3 --> Z7[Store raw and parsed]
    Z3 --> Z8[Early scoring]
    Z8 --> Z9{Need heavy crawl?}
    Z9 -->|Yes| ZA[Conditional JS or PDF crawl]
    Z9 -->|No| ZB[Skip heavy path]
    ZA --> ZC[Text normalization]
    ZB --> ZC
    ZC --> ZD[Rule-based extraction]
    ZD --> ZE[Light ranking]
    ZE --> ZF[Top evidence and outline]
    ZF --> ZG[Qwen final synthesis]
    ZG --> ZH[Persist results and metrics]

    ZE --> ZI[BM25 or TF-IDF]
    ZE --> ZJ[Keyword scoring]
    ZE --> ZK[Small embeddings when needed]

    Z --> ZL[Storage]
    ZL --> ZL1[SQLite or DuckDB]
    ZL --> ZL2[JSONL logs]
    ZL --> ZL3[Gzip raw HTML]

    Z --> ZM[Metrics]
    ZM --> ZM1[Crawl success rate]
    ZM --> ZM2[Parse success rate]
    ZM --> ZM3[Relevance score]
    ZM --> ZM4[Qwen latency]
    ZM --> ZM5[RAM peak]
